  <item>
    <title>东亚不孝女：大年夜没接妈妈电话｜EN 英语</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699dcefdde29766da9676137</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699dcefdde29766da9676137</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Feb 2026 16:20:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🧧Hey 我是RayRay，</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/696c1814ef1cf272a7f47c79" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/696c1814ef1cf272a7f47c79"><span>上一期</span></a><span>我提到二月我想聊和父母的关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>听到我出国，几乎所有人都问了我同一个问题：你爸妈支持吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然不。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我很想给自己一个机会梳理我在家庭关系中的曲折成长，和母女层层揪扯中的女性主义思索。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但我没有做到。</span></p><span></span><p><span>前几天在柏林电影节官网选片，有一个电影类型tag是#Family is complicated#，言简意赅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>家、父母之爱、母女关系，很复杂。有时我甘之如饴其乐融融，有时不得不以子之矛攻子之盾，有时需要退避三舍大事化小，有时必须没心没肺只管自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为一个县城传统家庭的单身独生女，我早被说过“不孝”了，坚决往外跑、过年不回家（以及很长一段时间不会回家）也一定会被最亲的人施以最深的打击。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有天晚上睡不着，把心里的话一股脑写了出来。因为不想让妈妈看到，这些话我是用英语人格诉说的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我相信这不仅仅是我们、东亚才有的经历，我在柏林认识的很多国家的女孩们都有类似的出走。我也想让幸免这些成长痛苦的人们看到基于性别的隐性束缚，和共性症结。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所幸的是，我们这一代女孩，迫于改变。</span></p><span></span><p><span>表弟看到，说很想听我亲自读。这期播客就是读我自己的文章，</span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a></span></strong><span> 开始。</span></p><span></span><p><span>原文在这里➡️ </span><a href="https://open.substack.com/pub/rayraywander/p/i-refused-my-moms-call?utm_campaign=post-expanded-share&amp;utm_medium=post%20viewer" data-url="https://open.substack.com/pub/rayraywander/p/i-refused-my-moms-call?utm_campaign=post-expanded-share&amp;utm_medium=post%20viewer"><span>I Refused My Mom’s Call on Chinese New Year</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎关注订阅我的英文Newsletter :)</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的其他平台：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a2bbf1d11be107a1a5653c3?tab=note" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a2bbf1d11be107a1a5653c3?tab=note"><span>小红书</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NeZEcwBbMKnU0qEIN82pog" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NeZEcwBbMKnU0qEIN82pog"><span>公众号</span></a><span> @CallMeRayRay</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/658ee91ff6281cf6d91f5901/lsOzz07Ve7nvboKydE9BwFS5Ljph.m4a" length="18485897" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:19:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh2HEk6DZhHGl4HTTbiRGoQDgjYI.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>心里有火，就不会冷｜什么是“冷不着”&amp;我们的2025冷不着时刻</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696c1814ef1cf272a7f47c79</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696c1814ef1cf272a7f47c79</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Jan 2026 00:04:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🔥终于（还算）正式地介绍《冷不着》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hey 我是RayRay，现在在柏林。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“冷不着”来自一位云南小朋友写给我的信——祝姐姐这个冬天冷不着。</span></p><span></span><p><span>后来它变成一枚橙色贴纸，一袋云南挂耳咖啡，一份信封包装的礼物，一个散播阳光的播客☀️</span></p><span></span><p><span>2026年，《冷不着》希望在每个月的17号（如果有时差那就是18号）更新。</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一期，聊聊“冷不着”背后的故事。也很幸运地邀请到8位主播朋友，分享他们2025年的“冷不着时刻”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>没想到我们都反复提到这些关键词：友情/小孩/什么也不做。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们对2026有各自的期待，也给声波那岸的你送上新年祝福：）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕙时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Spotify说我2025最喜欢的音乐类型是bedroom pop/我想做的播客是bedroom pod</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6">00:06</a> 关于我：RayRay名字的由来/RayRay是怎样的人/我为什么想做播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 播客已经是我人生不可分割的一部分/听众和主播就像好朋友这件事在德国也一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="926">15:26</a> 关于《冷不着》：“冷不着”的由来和变迁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1288">21:28</a> 2025我最喜欢的项目是</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4vM9vZFGddVS-JoaFskB9w" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4vM9vZFGddVS-JoaFskB9w"><span>给朋友们做“冷不着”云南挂耳咖啡礼物</span></a><span>/You won't be cold with flames in your heart/传到各地的冷不着贴纸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1963">32:43</a> 就像Coldplay的Yellow，“冷不着”的涵义是……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 朋友们的2025“冷不着时刻”/对2026的期待和祝福👇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2121">35:21</a> 花生酱 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2484">41:24</a> 《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6120baa0e1fc02d91e3519ae" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6120baa0e1fc02d91e3519ae"><span>Coffeeplus播客</span></a><span>》Yujia &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> 《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61289ae0e2ca6ba2170b5c03" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61289ae0e2ca6ba2170b5c03"><span>前后院儿</span></a><span>》陈太太 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3268">54:28</a> 《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/601fe936f0e237012f4d6df3" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/601fe936f0e237012f4d6df3"><span>小心地滑</span></a><span>》我不跑调 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3453">57:33</a> 《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5ecbca6e418a84a04626c5c3" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5ecbca6e418a84a04626c5c3"><span>痴人之爱</span></a><span>》阿酌 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3875">64:35</a> 《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e280fa7418a84a0461f8ff0" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e280fa7418a84a0461f8ff0"><span>午夜飞行</span></a><span>》VC &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4387">73:07</a> 《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5eb42a94418a84a0460c4328" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5eb42a94418a84a0460c4328"><span>过刊</span></a><span>》左小姐 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4580">76:20</a>《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f14330f6d7660742733a686" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f14330f6d7660742733a686"><span>周末变奏 Key Change</span></a><span>》方舟</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于“冷不着”的作品推荐：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>📺《老友记》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>📺 《29岁的圣诞节》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🧑‍🎨 丰子恺的漫画</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🎵 Hanson - A Song to Sing</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🎵 方舟：“把自己14岁最喜欢的专辑再拿出来听一次，看看能从回忆的缝隙里面捞到什么新的东西”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>提到的其他播客：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《无业游民》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《Fashion Neurosis with Bella Freud》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《anything goes with emma chamberlain》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>我的其他平台：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a2bbf1d11be107a1a5653c3?tab=note" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a2bbf1d11be107a1a5653c3?tab=note"><span>小红书</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4vM9vZFGddVS-JoaFskB9w" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4vM9vZFGddVS-JoaFskB9w"><span>公众号</span></a><span> @CallMeRayRay</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计：刘刘</span></p>]]></description>
