  <item>
    <title>是乐观怂人，也是强壮女人｜当女孩一直运动</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680a50b57a449ae85881997c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680a50b57a449ae85881997c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Apr 2025 15:06:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🏋🏽‍♀️ 2024开年，我和健身搭子花生酱回顾了开始频繁运动的2023，录了这期</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c9103a0bef6c2074d66a03" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c9103a0bef6c2074d66a03"><span>可以不爱男人但是不能不爱运动</span></a><span>；2025继续用“运动”开启，聊聊我们各自在2024的运动项目和身心习得。</span></p><span></span><p><span>注：本播客不是运动达人自律指南，不是无痛瘦身经验分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span>运动就是痛苦的，会停滞，会受伤。但过程也充满乐趣，和对生活的新体悟：运动是一种最小单位的重启人生，也是show up in life最简单的方式。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🕙时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">1:33</a> 从“逃生出口”到“生活支点”：运动是我的稳定剂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="233">3:53</a> 从习惯养成到主动参与：我会自己换杠铃片了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="479">7:59</a> 我们和私教的关系：老师-学生？销售-客户？咨询师-来访者？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1099">18:19</a> 夏日激情学舞记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a> 我的腿好粗，但我好开心！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a> 流动的生活，穿梭在团课间的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1843">30:43</a> 伤了两次腰，开始科学训练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2025">33:45</a> “2.5分时刻”：我是个心疼自己的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2146">35:46</a> 当“训练肌肉的意识”融入日常挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2376">39:36</a> 运动两年后的变化：追求变强，保持在场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2501">41:41</a> 女性生理周期的诡秘：没有普适的规律，只有个体的经验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2726">45:26</a> 只有先面对压力，才有可能瘦下来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2988">49:48</a> 运动对于我们的意义（不总结了，请听）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔗提到的播客：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《除你武器》</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c5d6aebf52a16cd14c228f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c5d6aebf52a16cd14c228f"><span>女孩无痛健身指南：都是自律害了我？</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>《独树不成林》</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e73a293a5ff0a0cab55d48" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e73a293a5ff0a0cab55d48"><span>运动如何帮我在低谷笑对生活往脸上呼的一个个大耳瓜子？</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>《独树不成林》</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675f8c8d84447b1bd027edfd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675f8c8d84447b1bd027edfd"><span>一具健康的肉体除了力量为何还需要灵活和平衡？</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/658ee91ff6281cf6d91f5901/lgxj0RG8RSpvLvkpO1rM2u1pdJh2.m4a" length="54117076" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm3Ekqo9YAYaEb73mkT-1kIUyTKx.png"/>
