  <item>
    <title>我独自旅行：INFJ在东京暴走，ENTP被东京人怒吼</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d482cf4a0f950f84bdc356</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d482cf4a0f950f84bdc356</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Sep 2024 00:52:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>✈️今年我重新扛起了solo traveler大旗，享受「独自」和「旅行」的加倍自在。想在播客里分享一个人的奇遇，偶尔也邀请朋友聊聊他们的solo trips. 这便是「我独自旅行」系列。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在上次聊</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666e668bc26e396a361596b8" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666e668bc26e396a361596b8"><span>香港、福冈、冲绳</span></a><span>之后，这期来聊东京。（为我的🇯🇵行做功课中📒</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的同桌&amp;Kpop同好 Ouli、脖子 今年前后脚去了东京。Ouli是一个独自暴走即日常的INFJ，在东京日均三万步心满意足。脖子是觉得一个人吃饭很“可怜”的ENTP，但在东京第一次感受到独自旅行的快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>What's more, 脖子还看了两天TWICE演唱会，有一些关于霓虹金的神奇观察！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🕙时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 随机抽考：每人说一个base东京的播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 东京适合什么时候去？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a> 典型INFJ和ENTP的行程对比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">04:57</a> 东京热门区域介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="898">14:58</a> 买通票还是西瓜卡小tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1003">16:43</a> 涩谷时尚的“地板”都很高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">19:11</a> 中古店、化妆品店、鞋店，服务水平持续在线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a> 日料和冰啤酒/冰可乐更配哦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">28:50</a> 有哪些“刻板印象”落实？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> 演唱会散场路上鸦雀无声，只有在日本发生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a> 点Cola上成科罗娜，酒精过敏都要喝3/4，只有在INFJ身上发生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2202">36:42</a> 颗粒度极细的神社：保护头发、保护自媒体专拜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> Twice东京演唱会体验大放送！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2831">47:11</a> Twice阳间魔力：让这个B班还能再上一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3273">54:33</a> 什么样的明星可以录好solo trip综艺？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 去东京独自旅行的建议？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔗我们提到的：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>- 潮流博主Saladbob的播客</span><strong><span>《</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6235958b85e8c28b4a7a9afb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6235958b85e8c28b4a7a9afb"><span>小岛秀乐</span></a><strong><span>》</span></strong><span>指路</span><strong><span> </span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657d4f296396a4645ac3d3e5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657d4f296396a4645ac3d3e5"><span>Ep6-东京衣食住行</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 月曜制作人徐P的播客《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65868182e1e1cc5f0874853d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65868182e1e1cc5f0874853d"><span>徐徐的</span></a><span>》指路 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66282944c3e09d8f3708f889" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66282944c3e09d8f3708f889"><span>#17 スタミナ苑，东京最好吃的烤肉</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 其他常驻东京的播客：《东京脱线时间》《Top of Japan》《霓虹电波》《现在进行时》</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 再次安利小宇宙23年推出的 </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KDp8GK2QZhIWeHPUpyvjaQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KDp8GK2QZhIWeHPUpyvjaQ"><span>东京夏日攻略（播客主理人版）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 为不了解Twice的朋友们指路 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ty421q7nB/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=1c726f72514878138afc0b7773242aed" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ty421q7nB/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=1c726f72514878138afc0b7773242aed"><span>Twice 今年上 Killing Voice 金曲串烧的视频</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📷脖子和Ouli的旅行照片：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ls9ZSkpC7ZiTpzSVzj9KVmPGEvgz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>夏日东京街头</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llVL3jDwMozBOb0ZdTdjyxbuaPPj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Twice演唱会的应援</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvPBtXZdpQdof_4tbvFX6SkvAxiO.m4a" length="60962260" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtGzZo14K2i3f1lOm0znEQ0uKGEP.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>去游泳就像是给自己放暑假</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a62b5e7349f7a5571519ac</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a62b5e7349f7a5571519ac</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Jul 2024 11:28:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🏊‍♀️「水像一种爱，让人松弛，有安全感的爱。」</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年我终于学会(?)了游泳，这期和花生酱漫谈和游泳有关的童年记忆和心路历程。一些柔软的暑假回忆浮起，感受到心流的具像化。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🕙时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">1:24</a> 和水有关的记忆，或温馨或惊恐</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>游完泳喝的草莓酸奶、躲在妈妈雨衣下听雨滴</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>一次溺水：水猴子在抓我的腿</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>被理发师羞辱：你是游泳健将吧？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>二次溺水：妈妈我以为我再也见不到你</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="664">11:04</a> 为什么怕水还要学游泳？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>想要战胜恐惧，就像蝙蝠侠</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>在内陆长大的小孩，对海的向往和陌生</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>动力利器：Apple Watch、骨传导耳机、音乐播客、上海体育消费券</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>动力伙伴：群昵称瞩目的女同事游泳群</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a> 大龄学游泳记</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>选择纠结路径最短的方式：最近的公立游泳馆</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>蛙泳卡在15m，总想站起来</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《晒后假日》般“和爸爸一起游泳”的投射</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>害怕接受陌生男性的善意，是社会经验的总和</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a> 随波逐流，继续漫谈</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>妈妈虽然你很可爱，但我不能和你一起游泳，因为…</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>我们无意识地在给自己设限</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>享受在水下的状态，把它当作「逍遥游」</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小时候跟爷爷奶奶在山洞里的消暑日常</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>🔗我们提到的：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>书影：《如雪如山》《晒后假日》</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JTuujSt-ibkKHElUxYGCyw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JTuujSt-ibkKHElUxYGCyw"><span>在日本海上漂流三天求生的中国女孩的故事</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhiuX98pohTdIf9e3p-xC6hoKxSm.m4a" length="55159894" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiHx40fbJxs8bSuQYwYL1QV7KZM9.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>朋友的求婚｜冷不着短讯</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669d7a2c8fcadceb90eb805d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669d7a2c8fcadceb90eb805d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Jul 2024 02:20:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>💐偶尔分享一些「冷不着」短讯。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天是一则幸福短讯：周日去见证了朋友的求婚，被求婚者是我的好姐妹Lynn，求婚者是我们共同的朋友Winter。我们在Toastmasters头马演讲俱乐部认识，几乎共度了20年底-21年上半年的每个周日。常常觉得工作后这样纯粹的友谊很难得，何况有的幸运儿还发展成了人生伴侣。</span></p><span></span><p><span>为关系更进一步而担起责任的人很帅、很美、很勇敢。幸福是会传染的，看到朋友们为爱而喜悦、哽咽、拥抱，让我对世界多了一份信心。我决定用我的方式祝贺他们。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">2:02</a> 为不知道头马的人介绍头马（建议倍速or跳过）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">9:52</a> 进入正片：认识浦东头马的朋友们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="651">10:51</a> 21年7月：Lynn的恋情开始 彼时我们还不知道男主角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">12:34</a> 23年12月：Lynn说会在新疆为我揭秘 但只字未提</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="965">16:05</a> 24年3月：说漏了！Lynn不得不第一时间找我坦白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1077">17:57</a> Lynn和我复盘（背景音是世纪公园的蝉鸣）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1341">22:21</a> 求婚过程：小号开始 全是细节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1508">25:08</a> Winter、Lynn现场采访片段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">28:24</a> 为不同的幸福模样开心</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loBV5w2eypUwhvDl5uTJIx_eJ8_U.m4a" length="32314390" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:00</itunes:duration>
