  </item>
  <item>
    <title>我独自旅行：香港、福冈、冲绳</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666e668bc26e396a361596b8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666e668bc26e396a361596b8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Jun 2024 04:14:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🗺️每个INFJ都需要有一段solo trip，就像每个INFJ都应该有一个solo播客（INFP也是）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Solo trip这件事，有第一次，还会有无数次。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾花生酱返场，我们聊了聊在香港、福冈、冲绳的独自旅行。内容略多（我还有很多没说完呢🫶🏻</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🕙时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">1:15</a> 为什么有这个播客《冷不着》？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">3:49</a> 为什么一个人旅行？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>找回锐气/创造变量/音乐节/机票盲盒……</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>一个人、和朋友、和对象旅行，你怎么排序？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>旅行是我从淡人切换浓人的开关</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a> 一个人出去玩怎么做攻略？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>听播客（在小宇宙搜城市名）/问朋友（和朋友keep in touch的方法）/看当地YouTuber视频/善用Bumble profile（没想到吧！）/城市旅游局自媒体/书影音圣地巡礼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>J人亿点震撼，P人醒来再看</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>相信Google Maps 4.5+分餐厅的含金量</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1752">29:12</a> 花生酱的第三次日本行</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>福冈：面包天堂/很好逛的福冈机场/明太子in everything/成都vibe</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>冲绳：沙滩相扑拔河/中日友好福州园/“要有钱 难过的时候也要在箱根的温泉里掉眼泪”/牧志海鲜市场</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2444">40:44</a> RayRay的第一次香港行</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>香港中央图书馆：意外的专业课考察</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>美荷楼：还爱住青旅，但姐只住单人间了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>深水埗：仿佛仍走在虹口/绿色爱好者狂喜（M+的厕所也是）/文艺小店citywalk</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>麦理浩径：上山下海走过沙滩/第二段小白友好</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>太平山顶：想起卑尔根山顶的星星点点/缆车的咯噔是暧昧的人的心跳</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>遗憾：只在周六晚变身爵士吧的理发店“Visage One”/团课昂贵/没去成百老汇看电影</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4636">1:17:16</a> 旅途里的相遇，全是量子力学（一些奇妙故事分享）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔗我们提到的：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>即友@百万港女的梦想 的</span><a href="https://hongkong.zhubai.love/posts/2233611023137579008" data-url="https://hongkong.zhubai.love/posts/2233611023137579008"><span>全方位香港旅行贴士</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>小宇宙推出的</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KDp8GK2QZhIWeHPUpyvjaQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KDp8GK2QZhIWeHPUpyvjaQ"><span>东京独家品味方式（播客主理人版）</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>花生酱推荐的</span><a href="https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/666086b59e2e9fda02cab670?s=ewoidSI6ICI1YzkwYWIwMmMwMDg4ODAwMTU2ZWZlNjQiCn0=" data-url="https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/666086b59e2e9fda02cab670?s=ewoidSI6ICI1YzkwYWIwMmMwMDg4ODAwMTU2ZWZlNjQiCn0="><span>3家福冈/冲绳好吃店</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>书影：《孤独的美食家》《春宵苦短，少女前进吧！》《我在京都居酒屋》《东京八平米》《过春天》《不够善良的我们》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>相册管理App：Slidebox</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>📷照片分享：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjw4xkeD6i1R0R6yPr7yptmZT-LE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>麦理浩径二段的海</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm-lia6RmG89FXcK1ohlkG_7oave.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>花生酱在飞机上看到的冲绳的海</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhRJopOyouYLlUj4zvOxwYSWePZV.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>花生酱在福冈买面包🤤</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvJ9eOv7AdglvyMTs01ZZl3d79-n.m4a" length="96773779" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:37:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fktyiq4vu-D-kMguqUaIjowpvem2.png"/>
