  <item>
    <title>可以不爱男人但是不能不爱运动｜开始运动的原因</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c9103a0bef6c2074d66a03</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c9103a0bef6c2074d66a03</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Feb 2024 18:21:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🥊标题灵感来自《展开讲讲》</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/648e6b3e410dc007c7faca9b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/648e6b3e410dc007c7faca9b"><span>运动又不是男人，说不爱就不爱了</span></a><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本来是碎碎念播客，没想到这么快就有了嘉宾。年前和花生酱闲聊，意外地发现，促使我们从去年夏天爱上运动的动因，somehow都是前任。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以这期聊运动（也聊感情），不是因为分手而运动的故事，而是</span><strong><span>我们如何在运动中获得正反馈，通过运动追求什么，以及团课实用经验分享</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👧嘉宾：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>花生酱，《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f68b49a83c34e85dd5ac0b5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f68b49a83c34e85dd5ac0b5"><span>北海怪兽</span></a><span>》主播之一，也是我的赛博邻居、健身搭子</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🕙时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 「运」动是转运的开始/运动「运」来</span></p><span></span><p><span>花生酱对运动的追求四阶段：变瘦-变爽-变美-变强</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="233">03:53</a> 变瘦</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>从有审美观念开始，以为好看=瘦</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小时候爸爸就带我跑步，目标参加奥运会</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">06:52</a> 变爽</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>工作后需要高强度运动宣泄压力</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>午休去BodyCombat暴汗一小时</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>教练：想象面前是你的前男友，你要怎么打他？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="641">10:41</a> 变美</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在一起第二天，开始白瘦幼审美规训</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>男人可以说不爱就不爱，Apple Watch还是要戴</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“精神分手”，通过运动转移注意力</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>感谢韩国女团把我拉出感情的迷雾</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>尊巴、搏击、骑车，夏夜充满活力</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>RayRay的恋爱雷达又成功感应</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 没有运动基础belike:</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>我爸怎么给我缺失了体育教育</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>体育课男生打篮球踢足球，女生没有团体运动</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>滚到我脚前的球，我也不敢踢回去</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1792">29:52</a> 为何我们都从团课开始爱上运动？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>只要自己去就行，I人友好</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>没有人关注你跳的怎么样，跳就完事了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>尊巴课站最后一排（花生酱）和第一排C位（RayRay)的人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>除了尊巴和搏击，我们分别的团课No.3：蹦床、战绳</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2019">33:39</a> 初尝运动进步滋味</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>仰慕把运动作为日常来践行的人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>我恨波比跳，但我不想只有我一个人站着</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2203">36:43</a> 运动之于人生的掌控感</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>花生酱：运动不像感情或者工作，运动只要投入就有回报</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>RayRay：运动一旦开始就很难停下，让齿轮转起来，自然而然会出现大的变化</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2311">38:31</a> 分手和被分手的情绪漩涡</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>回过头，分手BE就是一个人生节点而已</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>运动后即使大汗淋漓，精神状态也是美的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>用稳定的运动routine过渡新的生活</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a> 穿插ClassPass万馆达、Crossfit、乐刻的体验介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2840">47:20</a> 那个我仰慕的特质，为什么不可以自己拥有？</span></p><span></span><p><span>RayRay对运动的追求三阶段：健康-强壮-性感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2946">49:06</a> 健康：压力暴食的自救</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3344">55:44</a> 强壮：力量训练的正反馈</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>教练原来在偷偷卷我们</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>运动让每个人更好地认识自己的身体，遵从她的规律</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3536">58:56</a> 性感：收放自如的魅力</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>极致的自我认同</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>非单一的曲线美</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>身体和情感的掌控力</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3658">60:58</a> 合理预期，虽然运动这事儿确实挺好的</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔗提到的播客&amp;文章：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>播客「Passion Fruits」</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6580cf77ffbe2ac50b9bbf9d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6580cf77ffbe2ac50b9bbf9d"><span>你在哪办了健身卡？从健身行业商业模式简析，到小白到底该怎么开始？</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658acdf2b8fd2bc06011e032" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658acdf2b8fd2bc06011e032"><span>RayRay和芒芒录的播客</span></a><span>（出租车里疗愈1-1）</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/gYCewX2L-SMRC-FkBlROog" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/gYCewX2L-SMRC-FkBlROog"><span>在清迈不花钱跳尊巴</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4_PCzrP0SJQVjflWU6EipQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4_PCzrP0SJQVjflWU6EipQ"><span>I女团课指南</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Kv7DSgdlGEzwFer3BiaApw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Kv7DSgdlGEzwFer3BiaApw"><span>开启你的运动元年</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
